===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[eke]] [[out]]|ekes out|eking out|eked out}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[supplement]]
#: ''The old man '''eked out''' his pension by selling vegetables from his garden.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[obtain]] with [[difficulty]] or [[effort]].
#: ''He '''eked out''' a living selling vegetables from the garden.''

